)BODY
@HELP: Messages -- N to P                       !ISFHMSG                      }
@COMMAND INPUT ===>_ISFHCMD                                                   }
@NOT AUTHORIZED FOR CMD
}    / commands need UPDATE access to SDSF.OPER.
@NOT AUTHORIZED FOR INIT}, @NOT AUTHORIZED FOR PRT
}    This action on an initiator or a printer needs UPDATE access to
}    SDSF.OPER; D needs READ.
@NOT AVAILABLE YET
}    The command takes no parameters yet, as LOG on the menu.
@NOT ENOUGH STORAGE
}    The list or the output does not fit into the storage SDSF has. On
}    output, what fits is shown. A larger region at logon helps.
@OUTPUT NOT READABLE
}    The data set could not be read.
