}    Help: the panel of that topic is not there; the panel before stays.
@PARM INVALID
}    A parameter of the command is not right. The cursor is on it.
@PRINT OPENED}, @PRINT ALREADY OPEN}, @PRINT OPEN ERROR
}    PRINT OPEN or ODSN: the file is open, was open before, or could not
}    be opened.
}
}
